flowchart LR
    subgraph SYSTEM["Sales Analytics System — proposed components"]
        UI["Web UI<br/>Import / review / dashboard"]
        API["FastAPI API<br/>Authentication and scoped authorization<br/>CSV ingest / link / query / search<br/>Review / analytics / export"]
        DB[("PostgreSQL<br/>Metadata / segments / extractions<br/>Revisions / job states / audit")]
        STORE[("Private object store<br/>Authorized audio<br/>Restricted object access")]
        QUEUE["Redis broker<br/>Celery task queue<br/>ASR and deletion jobs"]
        subgraph WORKER["Python / Celery worker — asynchronous"]
            ASR["Whisper ASR<br/>Optional diarization"]
            EXTRACT["Evidence extraction<br/>Draft observations"]
            DELETE["Retention / deletion handler<br/>Reconciled cleanup"]
        end
        EVAL["Offline evaluation<br/>Versioned test data and metrics"]

        UI -->|HTTPS / role scope| API
        API -->|Authorized metadata and queries| DB
        API -->|Store authorized audio| STORE
        API -->|Enqueue job IDs| QUEUE
        QUEUE -->|Consume jobs / bounded retries| WORKER
        ASR --> EXTRACT
        STORE -->|Read authorized audio| WORKER
        DELETE -->|Delete authorized objects| STORE
        WORKER -->|Versioned results / status / audit| DB
        DELETE -->|Delete derivatives / retain content-free audit| DB
        EVAL -.->|Permitted versioned evaluation data| DB
    end

    %% Audio transfers use private object access; queue messages contain identifiers,
    %% not full recordings. Job completion is persisted in PostgreSQL.
    %% Retention requests pass through API authorization and asynchronous deletion jobs.
    %% A backup expiry policy is required; deleting active data does not erase backups instantly.
    %% CSV is the mandatory initial CRM interface; FR16 live connector is deferred.
    %% No component writes automatic updates back to a CRM.
